OL,3,CFirst Minister promises answers for
OL,4,Cvictims of quarry blast flooding
OL,6,FThe First Minister has promised
OL,7,Fanswers for victims of the flooding in
OL,8,FGwaelod-y-Garth following a quarry
OL,9,Fblast on Thursday.
OL,11,FRhun ap Iorwerth visited the area near
OL,12,FCardiff in which more than a dozen
OL,13,Fhomes were flooded just minutes after
OL,14,Fa "planned blast" at a nearby quarry
OL,15,Fin Taff's Well.
OL,17,FQuarry owners The Breedon Group said:
OL,18,F'"Following Thursday's incident, our
OL,19,Fabsolute priority remains supporting
OL,20,Fthose affected.''
OL,26,@zD@BOU
