OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F431A1785608302
OL,3,CFirst Minister promises answers for
OL,4,Cvictims of quarry blast flooding
OL,6,F''Our team on the ground continues to
OL,7,Fwork with the local community. We are
OL,8,Falso working with the HSE and other
OL,9,Flocal authorities on their
OL,10,Finvestigation.''
OL,12,FThe First Minister told ITV News
OL,13,Fmultiple investigations would
OL,14,Fdetermined what happened.
OL,16,FResidents reported a sudden torrent of
OL,17,Ffloodwater and silt rushing into their
OL,18,Fhomes, gardens, and vehicles on
OL,19,FThursday without warning.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/4
