OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F431A1785608302
OL,3,CFirst Minister promises answers for
OL,4,Cvictims of quarry blast flooding
OL,6,FVideos and images captured by
OL,7,Fresidents show the force of the water
OL,8,Fentering homes and forcing cars down
OL,9,Fthe road as it rushed through the
OL,10,Fstreets.
OL,12,FOne resident told ITV News how a
OL,13,F"force of water" came towards him and
OL,14,F"pushed him off his feet".
OL,16,FA major cleanup operation has
OL,17,Fcontinued this weekend, with
OL,18,Fvolunteers from across the wider area
OL,19,Ftravelling to help residents whose
OL,20,Fhomes have been filled with debris and
OL,21,Fwater damage.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G3/4
